window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c352-f0389bbdbc25200a.json"]={sha256:"f0389bbdbc25200a6933f5324f28e573957cc65325be36cdac1656fc396b93f1",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-d6f73b99f0cb8d01","url":"https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Venus_Express","title":"ESA Venus Express","titleEn":"ESA Venus Express","publisher":"ESA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c352","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c352","related":[{"id":"c353","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/viking/"],"title":"Viking 火星登陸計畫","titleEn":"Viking Mars landing program","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：只有在配準殘差換算速度小於教學容許值 10 m/s 且特徵可追蹤時報告漂移。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Report drift only when registration residuals imply less than the teaching allowance of 10 m/s and tracers remain identifiable. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"用對照扣除與不確定度傳播說明「有訊號」和「有生命」是不同命題。","differenceEn":"Use control subtraction and uncertainty propagation to distinguish a signal from evidence of life.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成雲標記位移 240 km，影像相隔 40 min，忽略投影縮短。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：v=240000/(40×60)。 結果約 100 m/s。局部平面且高度固定時 v=位移/時間；影像特徵不一定是同一空氣團。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成樣本反應 12±2 單位，滅活對照 7±2 單位，兩個 ± 均為獨立 1σ。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：z=(12−7)/sqrt(2²+2²)。 結果約 1.76777 σ。獨立量測相減時方差相加；顯著差值只能排除指定零假設，不能唯一識別機制。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic cloud displacement is 240 km over 40 min, neglecting foreshortening. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: v=240000/(40×60). Result ≈ 100 m/s. For a local plane at fixed altitude, v=displacement/time; an image feature need not track the same air parcel.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic sample response is 12±2 units and inactivated control 7±2 units; uncertainties are independent 1σ. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: z=(12−7)/sqrt(2²+2²). Result ≈ 1.76777 σ. Independent subtraction adds variances; a significant difference rejects a specified null, not every alternative mechanism.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c362","referenceUrls":["https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Mars_Express"],"title":"Mars Express 火星探測","titleEn":"Mars Express","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：只有在配準殘差換算速度小於教學容許值 10 m/s 且特徵可追蹤時報告漂移。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Report drift only when registration residuals imply less than the teaching allowance of 10 m/s and tracers remain identifiable. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"把雙程雷達延遲換算成介質厚度，明確保留介電常數歧義。","differenceEn":"Convert two-way radar delay into layer thickness while retaining dielectric ambiguity.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成雲標記位移 240 km，影像相隔 40 min，忽略投影縮短。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：v=240000/(40×60)。 結果約 100 m/s。局部平面且高度固定時 v=位移/時間；影像特徵不一定是同一空氣團。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成地表與深部回波相差 10 μs，c=3×10⁸ m/s，εr=4。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：d=3×10⁸×10⁻⁵/(2sqrt(4))。 結果約 750 m。均勻無色散介質中 d=cΔt/(2sqrt(εr))；亮回波不能單獨證明液態水。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic cloud displacement is 240 km over 40 min, neglecting foreshortening. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: v=240000/(40×60). Result ≈ 100 m/s. For a local plane at fixed altitude, v=displacement/time; an image feature need not track the same air parcel.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic surface-to-subsurface delay is 10 μs, c=3×10⁸ m/s and εr=4. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: d=3×10⁸×10⁻⁵/(2sqrt(4)). Result ≈ 750 m. For a uniform nondispersive medium d=cΔt/(2sqrt(εr)); a bright echo alone cannot establish liquid water.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-4731afada99df59e","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/viking/","title":"Viking Mars landing program — NASA Science","titleEn":"Viking Mars landing program — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-54485484eb05bd05","url":"https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Mars_Express","title":"ESA Mars Express","titleEn":"ESA Mars Express","publisher":"ESA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
